      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Find the value of S/2 if S = 21 + 27 + 33 + ...... till 24 terms. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; S = 21 + 27 + 33 + ...... 24 &#2346;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; S/2 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the value of S/2 if S = 21 + 27 + 33 + ...... till 24 terms.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; S = 21 + 27 + 33 + ...... 24 &#2346;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; S/2 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1080 1080",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1080</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1080</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "900 900",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">900</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">900</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1200 1200",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1200</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1200</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "960 960",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">960</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">960</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>S = 21 + 27 + 33 + ..... Till 24 terms</p><p>This is an arithmetic progression with a = 21, d = 6, n = 24</p><p>We know that,</p><p>Sum (S) = (n/2) [2a + (n  -  1) x d]</p><p>S = 12 [42 + 23 x 6]</p><p>S = 12 x 180</p><p>S/2 = 6 x 180 = 1080</p>",
