      "question": "If the 3 rd term of a geometric progression is -21 and common ratio is 3 then 5 th term of the series is: &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2379;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; -21 &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 3 &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2306;&#2330;&#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If the 3<sup>rd</sup> term of a geometric progression is -21 and common ratio is 3 then 5<sup>th</sup> term of the series is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2379;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; -21 &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 3 &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2306;&#2330;&#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "-486 -486",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">-486</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-486</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "-189 -189",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">-189</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-189</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-148 -148",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">-148</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-148</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "-729 -729",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">-729</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-729</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>3<sup>rd</sup> term = -21</p><p>ar<sup>2</sup> = -21</p><p>a x 9 = -21</p><p>a = -7/3</p><p>5<sup>th</sup> term = ar<sup>4</sup></p><p>= (-7/3) x (3)<sup>4</sup></p><p>= -7 x 27 = -189</p>",
