      "question": "Find the value of X, if X = -9 - 7 - 5 - 3 - 1 + 1 + ...... till 20 terms. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X = -9 - 7 - 5 - 3 - 1 + 1 + ...... 20 &#2346;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; &#2361;&#2379; &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the value of X, if X = -9  -  7  -  5  -  3  -  1 + 1 + ...... till 20 terms.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X = -9 - 7 - 5 - 3 - 1 + 1 + ...... 20 &#2346;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; &#2361;&#2379; &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "100 100",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">100</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">100</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "200 200",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">200</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">200</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "50 50",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">50</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">50</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0 0",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>X = -9  -  7  -  5  -  3  -  1 + 1 + .... till 20 terms.</p><p>This is an arithmetic progression with a = -9, d = 2, and n = 20.</p><p>Using the sum of series formula:</p><p>X = (n/2) [2a + (n  -  1) d]</p><p>X = 10 x [-18 + 38]</p><p>X = 10 x 20</p><p>X = 200</p>",
