      "question": "How many natural numbers are there between 103 and 460 which are divisible by 9? 103 &#2324;&#2352; 460 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; 9 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>How many natural numbers are there between 103 and 460 which are divisible by 9?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>103 &#2324;&#2352; 460 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; 9 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
