        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "50 50",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">50</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">50</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "40 40",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">40</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">40</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "45 45",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">45</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">45</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>First number that is divisible by 9 = 108</p><p>Last number that is divisible by 9 = 459</p><p>Difference = 9</p><p>Total number of terms or numbers between 108 and 459 = [(459  -  108)/9] + 1 = 40</p>",
