    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Find the first term of an arithmetic progression whose 8 th and 13 th terms are 18 and 25 respectively. &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; 8&#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; 13&#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 18 &#2324;&#2352; 25 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the first term of an arithmetic progression whose 8<sup>th</sup> and 13<sup>th</sup> terms are 18 and 25 respectively.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; 8&#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; 13&#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 18 &#2324;&#2352; 25 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "41/5 41/5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">41/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">41/5</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "8 8",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "10/3 10/3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">10/3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">10/3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "42/5 42/5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">42/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">42/5</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>8<sup>th</sup> term = 18</p><p>a + 7d = 18 ... (1)</p><p>13<sup>th</sup> term = 25</p><p>a + 12d = 25 ... (2)</p><p>After solving eq (1) and (2),</p><p>We get d = 7/5</p><p>Now, from equation (1),</p><p>a + 7 x (7/5) = 18</p><p>a = 18  -  (49/5)</p><p>a = (90  -  49)/5 = 41/5</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "If the first term of an arithmetic progression is 5 and common difference is 7 then find the 10 th term of the series. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; 5 &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; 7 &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2360;&#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If the first term of an arithmetic progression is 5 and common difference is 7 then find the 10<sup>th</sup> term of the series.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; 5 &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; 7 &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2360;&#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "57 57",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">57</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">57</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "68 68",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">68</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">68</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "62 62",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">62</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">62</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "55 55",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">55</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">55</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>10<sup>th</sup> term of the AP = a + 9d = 5 + 9 x 7 = 68</p>",
      "images": [],
