      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q11",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "What is the sum of cubes of number from (11 to 20)? (11 &#2360;&#2375; 20) &#2340;&#2325; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2328;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the sum of cubes of number from (11 to 20)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(11 &#2360;&#2375; 20) &#2340;&#2325; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2328;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "21075 21075",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">21075</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21075</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "43070 43070",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">43070</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">43070</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "51025 51025",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">51025</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">51025</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "41075 41075",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">41075</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">41075</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>Sum of cubes of first n natural numbers = ((n x (n +1))/2)<sup>2</sup></p><p>Sum of cubes of the numbers from (11 to 20)</p><p>= (Sum of cubes of numbers from 1 to 20)  -  (Sum of cubes of the numbers from 1 to 10)</p><p>= ((20 x21)/2)<sup>2</sup>  -  ((10 x11)/2)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (210)<sup>2</sup>  -  (55)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 44100 - 3025 = 41075</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q12",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "What is the sum of first 24 terms of 2 + 4 + 4 + 7 + 8 + 10 + 16 + 13 + ....? 2 + 4 + 4 + 7 + 8 + 10 + 16 + 13 + .... &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; 24 &#2346;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the sum of first 24 terms of 2 + 4 + 4 + 7 + 8 + 10 + 16 + 13 + ....?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>2 + 4 + 4 + 7 + 8 + 10 + 16 + 13 + .... &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; 24 &#2346;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "8046 8046",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8046</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8046</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "8176 8176",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8176</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8176</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "8436 8436",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8436</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8436</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "8686 8686",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8686</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8686</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Let S = (2 + 4 + 4 + 7 + 8 + 10 + 16 + 13 + ....)</p><p>Given series is a combination of A.P and G.P. and,</p><p>Sum of first 24 terms = sum of first 12 terms of G.P + sum of first 12 terms of A.P</p><p>Series in G.P = 2 + 4 + 8 + 16 + ...</p><p>First term = a = 2</p><p>Common ratio = r = 4/2 = 2</p><p>n = 12</p><p>Then, sum = a(r<sup>n </sup> -  1)/(r  -  1)</p><p>= 2(2<sup>12</sup>  -  1)/(2  -  1)</p><p>= 8190</p><p>Series in A.P = 4 + 7 + 10 + 13 + ...</p><p>First term = a = 4</p><p>Common difference = 7  -  4 = 3</p><p>n = 12</p><p>Then, sum = (n/2)(2a + (n  -  1)d)</p><p>= (12/2)(2 * 4 + (12  -  1)3)</p><p>= 246</p><p>Therefore, sum of first 24 terms = 8190 + 246 = <b>8436</b></p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q13",
      "number": 13,
      "question": "The 10 th term of a geometric series is 8 times the 7 th term of the series. If 5 th term of the series is 80, then what is the 8 th term of the series? &#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2379;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2338;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; 10&#2357;&#2366;&#2305; &#2346;&#2342;, &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2338;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; 7&#2357;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2366; 8 &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2338;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; 5&#2357;&#2366;&#2305; &#2346;&#2342; 80 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2338;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; 8&#2357;&#2366;&#2305; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The 10<sup>th</sup> term of a geometric series is 8 times the 7<sup>th</sup> term of the series. If 5<sup>th</sup> term of the series is 80, then what is the 8<sup>th</sup> term of the series?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2379;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2338;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; 10&#2357;&#2366;&#2305; &#2346;&#2342;, &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2338;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; 7&#2357;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2366; 8 &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2338;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; 5&#2357;&#2366;&#2305; &#2346;&#2342; 80 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2338;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; 8&#2357;&#2366;&#2305; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1280 1280",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1280</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1280</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "320 320",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">320</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">320</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "640 640",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">640</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">640</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "2560 2560",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2560</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2560</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The 10<sup>th</sup> term of a geometric series is 8 times the 7<sup>th</sup> term of the series.</p><p>=&gt; ar<sup>9</sup> = 8 * ar<sup>6</sup></p><p>=&gt; r<sup>3</sup> = 8</p><p>=&gt; r = 2</p><p>5<sup>th</sup> term of the series is 80.</p><p>=&gt; ar<sup>4</sup> = 80</p><p>=&gt; a * 2<sup>4</sup> = 80</p><p>=&gt; a = 80/16</p><p>=&gt; a = 5</p><p>Hence, 8<sup>th</sup> term of the series = 5 * 2<sup>7</sup> = 640</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q14",
      "number": 14,
      "question": "&#160;Average of all natural numbers between 1268 and 1986 is __________. 1268 &#2324;&#2352; 1986 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; _____ &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>&#160;Average of all natural&nbsp;numbers between 1268 and 1986 is __________.</p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>1268 &#2324;&#2352; 1986 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; _____ &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1645 1645",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1645</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1645</span>"
