      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>\"Average of an arithmetic progression = (First term + last term)/2</p><p>So the first no&nbsp;is 1269 and the last number is 1985</p><p>Average=(first+last)/2</p><p>Average = (1269 + 1985)/2 = 1627</p><p>\"</p>",
