    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q16",
      "number": 16,
      "question": "Third and sixth term of a Geometric Progression are 16 and 432 respectively. Calculate the sum of its first term and common ratio. &#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2379;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2331;&#2336;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 16 &#2324;&#2352; 432 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2339;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Third and sixth term of a Geometric Progression are 16 and 432 respectively. Calculate the sum of its first term and common ratio.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2379;&#2340;&#2352; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2331;&#2336;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 16 &#2324;&#2352; 432 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2339;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "25/3 25/3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">25/3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">25/3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "22/3 22/3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">22/3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">22/3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "40/9 40/9",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">40/9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">40/9</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "43/9 43/9",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">43/9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">43/9</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>For the given Geometric Progression:</p><p>Let first term = a</p><p>And, common ratio = r</p><p>Third term in geometric progression = ar<sup>2</sup> = 16</p><p>a = 16/r<sup>2</sup></p><p>Sixth term in geometric progression = ar<sup>5</sup> = 432</p><p>Then, (16/r<sup>2</sup>) x r<sup>5</sup> = 432</p><p>r = 3</p><p>Now, a = 16/(3 * 3) = 16/9</p><p>Therefore, a + r = (16/9) + 3 = <b>43/9</b></p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q17",
      "number": 17,
      "question": "Find the value of S, if S = 117 + 111 + 105 + ....... 20 terms. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; S = 117 + 111 + 105 + ....... 20 &#2346;&#2342; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; S &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the value of S, if</p><p>S = 117 + 111 + 105 + ....... 20 terms.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; S = 117 + 111 + 105 + ....... 20 &#2346;&#2342; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; S &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1200 1200",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1200</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1200</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1320 1320",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1320</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1320</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1180 1180",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1180</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1180</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1440 1440",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1440</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1440</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>117 + 111 + 105 + ------- 20 terms</p><p>The series is in arithmetic progression.</p><p>a = 117, d = 111  -  117 = - 6 and n = 20</p><p>S<sub>20</sub> = 20/2 *[2*117 + 19*(-6)]</p><p>= 10 * [234 - 114]</p><p>= 1200</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q18",
      "number": 18,
      "question": "Find the sum of all natural number between 50 and 450 which are divisible by 13: 50 &#2324;&#2352; 450 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; 13 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the sum of all natural number between 50 and 450 which are divisible by 13:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>50 &#2324;&#2352; 450 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; 13 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "7904 7904",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">7904</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7904</span>"
