      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>\"</p><p>S <sub>n</sub> = 52 + 65 + ----- + 442</p><p>52 + (n &#8211; 1)13 = 442 (AP series)</p><p>(n &#8211;1)13 = 390</p><p>(n &#8211;1) = 30</p><p>n = 31</p><p><img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/e7a3fa30ee3a49f5642065adc769c009.png\" /></p><p>\"</p>",
