    {
      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q19",
      "number": 19,
      "question": "Find the value of X, if X = 14 - 14 + 14 - 14 + 14.........up to 31 st terms. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X = 14 - 14 + 14 - 14 + 14.........31&#2357;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2340;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the value of X, if X = 14  -  14 + 14  -  14 + 14.........up to 31<sup>st</sup> terms.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X = 14 - 14 + 14 - 14 + 14.........31&#2357;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2340;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "-14 -14",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">-14</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-14</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "28 28",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">28</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">28</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "14 14",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">14</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">14</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "7 7",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Total number of terms are 31.</p><p>Value of first two terms = 14  -  14 = 0</p><p>So, till 30<sup>th</sup> term the value of series will be 0.</p><p>And since 31<sup>st</sup> term is 14 so the answer of X will be 14.</p>",
