      "id": "5cf793b8c97d-q20",
      "number": 20,
      "question": "The average of all numbers from 113 to 959 which is multiple of 7 and 9 is ________. 113 &#2360;&#2375; 959 &#2340;&#2325; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2332;&#2379; 7 &#2324;&#2352; 9 &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2332; &#2361;&#2376; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; __________ &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The average of all numbers from 113 to 959 which is multiple of 7 and 9 is ________.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>113 &#2360;&#2375; 959 &#2340;&#2325; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2332;&#2379; 7 &#2324;&#2352; 9 &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2332; &#2361;&#2376; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; __________ &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "524.5 524.5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">524.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">524.5</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "545.5 545.5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">545.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">545.5</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "535.5 535.5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">535.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">535.5</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "534.5 534.5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">534.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">534.5</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>All the numbers between 113 to 959 which is multiple of 7 and 9 i.e., 63 = (126, 189, 252, .., 945)</p><p>Number of terms = (945  -  126)/63 + 1 = 14</p><p>Sum = 14/2 * (126 + 945) = 7497</p><p>So, required average = 7497/14 = 535.5</p><p>Alternate method:</p><p>Average of an A.P = (last number + first number)/2</p><p>Required average = (126 + 945)/2 = 535.5</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    }
